# `bin/production-deploy.js` builds the CLI installer (`web/cloud/tailchat.tar.gz`)
# with `git archive`, which honours `export-ignore`. The web client's Apple emoji
# PNGs (~9.5 MB) are only ever served to browsers; the terminal client never
# reads them, so they stay out of the download.
web/cloud/emoji/** export-ignore
# The Rust core's sources (`crates/`) are built only in a checkout, by
# `npm run build:core` (docs/specs/2026-11-01-rust-core.md §6); the installed
# terminal runs without the native module and never builds it.
crates/** export-ignore
